OL,3,GNEWSAProgress expected on 'eyesore'
OL,4,Aformer hotel
OL,5,
OL,6,FProgress to address the state of a
OL,7,Fdelapidated landmark building was
OL,8,Fexpected soon, a council says.
OL,10,FThe state of the former Royal Oak
OL,11,FHotel, an 18th century building in
OL,12,FSouth Street, Leominster, led to a
OL,13,Fprotest in the town last year.
OL,15,FHerefordshire Council confirmed it had
OL,16,Fserved a building notice on the owner
OL,17,Fof listed building, believed to be Jay
OL,18,FRai, after concerns were raised "over
OL,19,Funsafe masonry and window panes falling
OL,20,Fonto the pavement".
OL,23,APub: 20-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
