OL,3,GNEWSAProgress expected on 'eyesore'
OL,4,Aformer hotel
OL,5,
OL,6,FRai had complied with the notice and
OL,7,Fpaid for scaffolding and protective
OL,8,Fnetting around it. MP Ellie Chowns
OL,9,Fcalled the building an eyesore.
